---
code: records-glued-line
when-fires: a records line carried bytes after its terminal token (two atomic writes glued). plan/records.rs admit_records (the strict admission path); the forgiving deframer emits it too. Static.
why: 262 §2: reject the whole read unit, the safe direction (kFAIL-perform).
---
-- book.sh --
#!/bin/sh
hork tune --profile web

-- controller-results.txt --
dorc site 0 effect=holds rc=0 @@dorc@@ tail @@dorc@@

-- replay --
$ dorc plan --book=book.sh --results - < controller-results.txt > /dev/null
records: warning[records-glued-line]: sm a records line carried bytes after its
terminal token (two writes glued) -- the whole read unit is refused, the host
runs (kFAIL-perform)
